<title>ANTIGUA: CRICKET-OPENING DAY OF WINDIES-INDIA TEST WASHED OUT.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-OPENING DAY OF WINDIES-INDIA TEST WASHED OUT.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOHNS, Antigua 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>A saturated outfield forced the abandonment of the opening day of the fourth test between West Indies and India on Friday.</p>
</text>
